{"id":"en_the-day-i-cut-them-off","title":"The Day I Cut Them Off","titleEn":"The Day I Cut Them Off","description":"Emma had spent years emptying her savings for relatives who saw her generosity as something they were owed. The turning point came at her wedding, which they failed to attend, each offering nothing more than a five-dollar gift card. That slight laid bare what she had refused to see. When they turned on her with cruelty, Emma abandoned her habit of apologizing and chose to stand her ground instead.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-day-i-cut-them-off/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-day-i-cut-them-off/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Melodrama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds64s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-day-i-cut-them-off_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds64s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-day-i-cut-them-off_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds64s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-day-i-cut-them-off_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds64s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-day-i-cut-them-off_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds64s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-day-i-cut-them-off_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-